								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=2468.msg29555#msg29555">Lupe Fiasco's business partner/sentenced to 44 years in jail...</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> June 05, 2007, 03:44:01 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
